# Sample 19 — Nominal-voltage MVA cross-reference
#
# The selected setting is entered in MVA at the 11 kV side of a
# transformer, but the diagram declares 33 kV as its nominal voltage.
# The renderer shows the nominal-voltage MVA in brackets alongside the
# primary figure, so this set point stays comparable to one entered
# directly in MVA at the nominal voltage.

diagram "Transformer feeder — nominal MVA" {
  voltage 33 kV
  ct 300/1 A
  show current, mva

  below "11 kV side emergency load" must 50 MVA @ 11 kV margin 10%
  above "33 kV side minimum fault" must 300 MVA @ 33 kV margin 10%

  selected "Setting" 80 MVA @ 11 kV
}
